#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"
msgstr "Instalasi Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whether you will work locally or in a cloud environment, the first step for all users is to install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "Baik kamu bekerja secara lokal maupun di lingkungan cloud, langkah pertama untuk semua pengguna adalah menginstal Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"local\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"local\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit SDK {#install-the-qiskit-sdk}"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit SDK {#install-the-qiskit-sdk}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Python. Check the \"Programming Language\" section on the [Qiskit PyPI project page](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/) to determine which Python versions are supported by the most recent release. For download instructions, see the [Python Beginners Guide](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download).\n"
msgstr "Instal Python. Cek bagian \"Programming Language\" di [halaman proyek Qiskit di PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/) untuk mengetahui versi Python mana yang didukung oleh rilis terbaru. Untuk instruksi unduhan, lihat [Panduan Pemula Python](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    It is recommended that you use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html) to separate Qiskit from other applications.\n"
msgstr "    Disarankan untuk menggunakan [virtual environment Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html) agar Qiskit terpisah dari aplikasi lain.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    These instructions use the standard Python distribution from [pypi.org](https://pypi.org/). However, you can use other Python distributions, such as [Anaconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/anaconda/) or [miniconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/miniconda/), along with other dependency management workflows like [Poetry](https://python-poetry.org/docs/).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    Instruksi ini menggunakan distribusi Python standar dari [pypi.org](https://pypi.org/). Namun, kamu bisa menggunakan distribusi Python lain, seperti [Anaconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/anaconda/) atau [miniconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/miniconda/), bersama workflow manajemen dependensi lain seperti [Poetry](https://python-poetry.org/docs/).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"If you're new to virtual environments, click to expand for more information.\">\n"
"    A virtual Python environment is an isolated space to work with Python for a specific purpose — so you can install whatever packages you wish, and set up libraries, dependencies, and so on, without affecting the \"base\" Python environment on your machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"Jika kamu belum familiar dengan virtual environment, klik untuk melihat informasi lebih lanjut.\">\n"
"    Virtual environment Python adalah ruang terisolasi untuk bekerja dengan Python untuk tujuan tertentu — sehingga kamu bisa menginstal paket apa pun yang kamu mau, serta mengatur library, dependensi, dan lain-lain, tanpa memengaruhi lingkungan Python \"dasar\" di mesinmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    One important advantage of a virtual environment is that if your Python environment becomes corrupted somewhere along the way, you can easily delete the virtual environment and start over!\n"
msgstr "    Salah satu keuntungan penting dari virtual environment adalah jika lingkungan Python-mu rusak di suatu titik, kamu bisa dengan mudah menghapus virtual environment tersebut dan mulai dari awal!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Choose a preferred location in which to store information about your virtual environments. Typically they're stored in a directory named `.venv` within each project directory you're working in.\n"
"    </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Pilih lokasi yang kamu inginkan untuk menyimpan informasi tentang virtual environment-mu. Biasanya disimpan di direktori bernama `.venv` di dalam setiap direktori proyek yang sedang kamu kerjakan.\n"
"    </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    First, navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "    Pertama, navigasikan ke direktori proyekmu dan buat environment minimal yang hanya berisi Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Next, activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "    Selanjutnya, aktifkan environment baru-mu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
"              If using PowerShell:\n"
msgstr ""
"           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
"              Jika menggunakan PowerShell:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"             If using Git Bash:\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"             Jika menggunakan Git Bash:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             source .venv/scripts/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"              If using command prompt:\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             source .venv/scripts/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"              Jika menggunakan command prompt:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/installation/) if it's not already installed in your environment. Pip is a Python package manager that you use to install Qiskit and other Python packages. Use `pip list` to see what is in your virtual environment. In most Python environments, pip is already installed.\n"
msgstr "[Instal pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/installation/) jika belum terinstal di lingkunganmu. Pip adalah manajer paket Python yang kamu gunakan untuk menginstal Qiskit dan paket Python lainnya. Gunakan `pip list` untuk melihat apa yang ada di virtual environment-mu. Di sebagian besar lingkungan Python, pip sudah terinstal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit SDK.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install qiskit\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install qiskit\n"
"      ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      <Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Add visualization support\">\n"
"      If you intend to use visualization functionality or Jupyter notebooks, also install the `qiskit.visualization` module. See the [Visualizations API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) for more information.\n"
"      </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"      <Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Tambahkan dukungan visualisasi\">\n"
"      Jika kamu berniat menggunakan fungsionalitas visualisasi atau Jupyter notebook, instal juga modul `qiskit.visualization`. Lihat [referensi API Visualizations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"
"      </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"local-jupyter\"></span>\n"
"1. If you want to run a Jupyter notebook with the Qiskit packages you just installed, you need to install Jupyter in your environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"local-jupyter\"></span>\n"
"1. Jika kamu ingin menjalankan Jupyter notebook dengan paket Qiskit yang baru saja kamu instal, kamu perlu menginstal Jupyter di lingkunganmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install jupyter\n"
"      ```\n"
"    Then open your notebook as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      pip install jupyter\n"
"      ```\n"
"    Lalu buka notebook-mu seperti berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      jupyter notebook <path/to/notebook.ipynb>\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```shell\n"
"      jupyter notebook <path/to/notebook.ipynb>\n"
"      ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are planning to work locally and use simulators built into Qiskit, then your installation is done. If you want to run jobs on IBM&reg; QPUs, continue on to [set up your IBM Cloud&reg; account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu berencana bekerja secara lokal dan menggunakan simulator bawaan Qiskit, maka instalasimu sudah selesai. Jika kamu ingin menjalankan job di IBM&reg; QPU, lanjutkan ke [pengaturan akun IBM Cloud&reg;](cloud-setup).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit` by running `pip install -U qiskit`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tetap terkini dengan versi terbaru\">\n"
"Secara berkala cek [catatan rilis Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes) untuk melihat rilis baru. Kami merekomendasikan agar kamu sering memperbarui kebutuhan `qiskit` dengan menjalankan `pip install -U qiskit`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {#troubleshooting}"
msgstr "Pemecahan masalah {#troubleshooting}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`No Module 'qiskit'` error with Jupyter Notebook\">\n"
"  If you used ``pip install qiskit`` and set up your virtual environment in\n"
"  Anaconda, then you may get the ``No Module 'qiskit'`` error when you run a tutorial\n"
"  in Jupyter Notebook. If you have not installed Qiskit or set up your\n"
"  virtual environment, you can follow the [installation](#qiskit-install) steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Error `No Module 'qiskit'` di Jupyter Notebook\">\n"
"  Jika kamu menggunakan ``pip install qiskit`` dan menyiapkan virtual environment di\n"
"  Anaconda, kamu mungkin mendapatkan error ``No Module 'qiskit'`` saat menjalankan tutorial\n"
"  di Jupyter Notebook. Jika kamu belum menginstal Qiskit atau menyiapkan\n"
"  virtual environment-mu, kamu bisa mengikuti langkah [instalasi](#qiskit-install).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The error is caused when trying to import the Qiskit package in an\n"
"  environment where Qiskit is not installed. If you launched Jupyter Notebook\n"
"  from the Anaconda-Navigator, it is possible that Jupyter Notebook is running\n"
"  in the base (root) environment, instead of in your virtual\n"
"  environment. Choose a virtual environment in the Anaconda-Navigator from the\n"
"  **Applications on** dropdown menu. In this menu, you can see\n"
"  all of the virtual environments within Anaconda, and you can\n"
"  select the environment where you have Qiskit installed to launch Jupyter\n"
"  Notebook.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Error ini disebabkan saat mencoba mengimpor paket Qiskit di\n"
"  lingkungan yang tidak memiliki Qiskit terinstal. Jika kamu membuka Jupyter Notebook\n"
"  dari Anaconda-Navigator, kemungkinan Jupyter Notebook berjalan\n"
"  di lingkungan dasar (root), bukan di virtual environment-mu.\n"
"  Pilih virtual environment di Anaconda-Navigator dari\n"
"  menu dropdown **Applications on**. Di menu ini, kamu bisa melihat\n"
"  semua virtual environment di dalam Anaconda, dan kamu bisa\n"
"  memilih lingkungan tempat Qiskit terinstal untuk membuka Jupyter\n"
"  Notebook.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Compilation errors during installation\">\n"
"  Qiskit depends on a number of other open-source Python packages, which\n"
"  are automatically installed when doing ``pip install qiskit``. Depending on\n"
"  your system's platform and Python version, it is possible that a particular\n"
"  package does not provide pre-built binaries for your system. You can refer\n"
"  to [Operating system support](#operating-system-support) for a list of platforms supported by Qiskit, some\n"
"  of which may need an extra compiler. In cases where there are\n"
"  no precompiled binaries available, ``pip`` will attempt to compile the package\n"
"  from source, which in turn might require some extra dependencies that need to\n"
"  be installed manually.\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Error kompilasi saat instalasi\">\n"
"  Qiskit bergantung pada sejumlah paket Python open-source lainnya, yang\n"
"  otomatis terinstal saat melakukan ``pip install qiskit``. Tergantung pada\n"
"  platform dan versi Python di sistemmu, ada kemungkinan paket tertentu\n"
"  tidak menyediakan binary yang sudah dikompilasi untuk sistemmu. Kamu bisa merujuk\n"
"  ke [Dukungan sistem operasi](#operating-system-support) untuk daftar platform yang didukung Qiskit, beberapa\n"
"  di antaranya mungkin memerlukan compiler tambahan. Dalam kasus di mana tidak tersedia\n"
"  binary yang sudah dikompilasi, ``pip`` akan mencoba mengompilasi paket\n"
"  dari source, yang pada gilirannya mungkin membutuhkan beberapa dependensi tambahan yang perlu\n"
"  diinstal secara manual.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If the output of ``pip install qiskit`` contains similar lines to:\n"
msgstr "  Jika output dari ``pip install qiskit`` mengandung baris yang mirip dengan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  please check the documentation of the package that failed to install (in the\n"
"  example code, ``SOME_PACKAGE``) for information on how to install the libraries\n"
"  needed for compiling from source.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  silakan cek dokumentasi paket yang gagal diinstal (dalam contoh kode, ``SOME_PACKAGE``) untuk informasi tentang cara menginstal library yang dibutuhkan untuk kompilasi dari source.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"os-support\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"os-support\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating system support {#operating-system-support}"
msgstr "Dukungan sistem operasi {#operating-system-support}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit strives to support as many operating systems as possible, but due to limitations in available testing resources and operating system availability, not all operating systems can be supported. Operating system support for Qiskit is broken into three tiers with different levels of support for each tier. For platforms outside these, such as FreeBSD or WebAssembly (WASI), Qiskit may still be installable, but it is not tested and you will have to build Qiskit (and likely Qiskit’s dependencies) from source.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit berusaha mendukung sebanyak mungkin sistem operasi, tetapi karena keterbatasan sumber daya pengujian yang tersedia dan ketersediaan sistem operasi, tidak semua sistem operasi bisa didukung. Dukungan sistem operasi untuk Qiskit dibagi menjadi tiga tingkat dengan berbagai tingkat dukungan untuk masing-masing tingkat. Untuk platform di luar ini, seperti FreeBSD atau WebAssembly (WASI), Qiskit mungkin masih bisa diinstal, tetapi tidak diuji dan kamu harus membangun Qiskit (dan kemungkinan dependensi Qiskit) dari source.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, Qiskit only supports the CPython implementation of the Python language. Running with other Python interpreters such as PyPy is not supported.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, Qiskit hanya mendukung implementasi CPython dari bahasa Python. Menjalankan dengan interpreter Python lain seperti PyPy tidak didukung.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v2.x {#qiskit-v2x}"
msgstr "Qiskit v2.x {#qiskit-v2x}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the Qiskit v2.x release series, the supported platforms are:\n"
msgstr "Dalam seri rilis Qiskit v2.x, platform yang didukung adalah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 1\">\n"
"  Tier 1 operating systems are fully tested as part of the development processes to ensure any proposed change will function correctly. Pre-compiled binaries are built, tested, and published to PyPI as part of the release process. Typically, as long as there is a functioning Python environment installed, Qiskit can be installed on these operating systems without needing to install further dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 1\">\n"
"  Sistem operasi Tier 1 diuji sepenuhnya sebagai bagian dari proses pengembangan untuk memastikan setiap perubahan yang diusulkan akan berfungsi dengan benar. Binary yang sudah dikompilasi dibangun, diuji, dan diterbitkan ke PyPI sebagai bagian dari proses rilis. Biasanya, selama ada lingkungan Python yang berfungsi, Qiskit bisa diinstal di sistem operasi ini tanpa perlu menginstal dependensi tambahan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Tier 1 operating systems:\n"
msgstr "  Sistem operasi Tier 1:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux x86_64 (distributions compatible with the [manylinux 2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/) packaging specification).\n"
msgstr "Linux x86_64 (distribusi yang kompatibel dengan spesifikasi paket [manylinux 2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "macOS ARM64 (11.0 or newer)\n"
msgstr "macOS ARM64 (11.0 atau lebih baru)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows 64-bit (Windows 10 and later supported)\n"
msgstr "Windows 64-bit (Windows 10 dan yang lebih baru didukung)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Linux AArch64 (distributions compatible with the [manylinux 2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/) packaging specification)\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 2\">\n"
"  Tier 2 operating systems are not tested as part of the development process. However, pre-compiled binaries are built, tested, and published to PyPI as part of the release process, and these packages can be expected to be installed with only a functioning Python environment.\n"
"  There might be a delay in releasing packages for these systems, since test failures might not be detected until much later, and failures during publishing will not block the publication of the package for Tier 1 systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Linux AArch64 (distribusi yang kompatibel dengan spesifikasi paket [manylinux 2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/))\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 2\">\n"
"  Sistem operasi Tier 2 tidak diuji sebagai bagian dari proses pengembangan. Namun, binary yang sudah dikompilasi dibangun, diuji, dan diterbitkan ke PyPI sebagai bagian dari proses rilis, dan paket-paket ini bisa diharapkan diinstal hanya dengan lingkungan Python yang berfungsi.\n"
"  Mungkin ada penundaan dalam merilis paket untuk sistem-sistem ini, karena kegagalan uji mungkin tidak terdeteksi sampai jauh kemudian, dan kegagalan saat penerbitan tidak akan menghalangi penerbitan paket untuk sistem Tier 1.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Tier 2 operating systems:\n"
msgstr "  Sistem operasi Tier 2:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - macOS x86_64 (10.12 or later)\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 3\">\n"
"  Tier 3 operating systems are not tested as part of the development process. Pre-compiled binaries are built and published to PyPI as part of the release process but are not tested. They may not be installable with only a functioning Python environment and might require a C/C++ compiler or additional programs to build dependencies from source as part of the installation process. Support for these operating systems are best effort only.\n"
msgstr ""
"  - macOS x86_64 (10.12 atau lebih baru)\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tier 3\">\n"
"  Sistem operasi Tier 3 tidak diuji sebagai bagian dari proses pengembangan. Binary yang sudah dikompilasi dibangun dan diterbitkan ke PyPI sebagai bagian dari proses rilis tetapi tidak diuji. Mereka mungkin tidak bisa diinstal hanya dengan lingkungan Python yang berfungsi dan mungkin memerlukan kompiler C/C++ atau program tambahan untuk membangun dependensi dari source sebagai bagian dari proses instalasi. Dukungan untuk sistem operasi ini bersifat best effort saja.\n"

